{"type":"node","id":"issue002","parent_id":"f_issues","node_type":"requirement","title":"ISSUE-002 export stdout 模式 JSON 缺 nodes 计数","description":"--output 文件模式 JSON 返回 nodes 计数，stdout 模式只有 content/bytes，形状不一致","content":"【复现】dtp export <node> --format md --json → 字段 ok/format/bytes/root/content，无 nodes\n【对照】--output out.md --json → 有 nodes:12\n【修复方向】stdout 模式 JSON 统一附带 nodes 计数","extensions":{"severity":"P3","area":"commands/export.js"},"created_at":"2026-09-09T16:38:19.551Z","updated_at":"2026-09-09T16:38:19.551Z","version":1,"hash":"83322fd4700e923e113b38cddaad2b0f38c61bf651ace5d9ea03c764bc7d0dbc","tags":["P3","export","json"],"status":"draft"}
