{"type":"node","id":"issue004","parent_id":"f_issues","node_type":"requirement","title":"ISSUE-004 篡改包上写入无警告、篡改被静默洗白","description":"哈希不匹配的节点可被直接 update 成功，写路径零提示；篡改内容升版后哈希重算即洗白","content":"【复现】手改 JSONL 中某 node 行 title 后 dtp update <该节点> --description x → ok:true 无任何 warning\n【期望】不阻断（保持文档语义）但 JSON 加 warnings 字段 + stderr 提示节点哈希不匹配\n【修复方向】写入路径加载后复用 verify 的哈希校验，检出时附加 warning","extensions":{"severity":"P3","area":"storage/packet"},"created_at":"2026-09-09T16:38:19.774Z","updated_at":"2026-09-09T16:38:19.774Z","version":1,"hash":"07ff892135db24abbc9546c93b35bb9cda36bd7ee84abeedbe325228cc6b5c71","tags":["P3","integrity","write-path"],"status":"draft"}
