{"type":"node","id":"optim002","parent_id":"f_optim","node_type":"knowledge","title":"OPTIM-002 query --limit 截断时人类输出不提示总数","description":"JSON 输出有 total 字段，但人类表格输出被 --limit 截断时只显示已返回条数，不知还有多少被截","content":"【现状】query --limit 2 命中 5 条 → 表格后仅「2 个节点」\n【建议】count < total 时表格后加暗色提示「共 N 个节点（--limit 截断）」","extensions":{"severity":"P3","area":"commands/query.js,_shared.js"},"created_at":"2026-09-09T17:51:55.942Z","updated_at":"2026-09-09T17:55:47.329Z","version":2,"hash":"03488e88ced2f0a5b4c2576318dc313317b2c9260a6cb1f282fdabd02716cbc4","tags":["P3","query","ux"],"status":"review"}
