{"type":"node","id":"fix004","parent_id":"f_fixlog","node_type":"document","title":"FIX-004 输出预检与 verify 错误契约（ISSUE-006/007）","description":"_shared.js 新增 assertWritableOutput（目录不存在→USAGE exit 2，export/pack 接入）；verify 对缺失包/目录包改抛标准 NO_PACKET 错误（原先返回 warnings:[] 的 checks 形状，按 warnings 判定的调用方会漏检）","content":"","extensions":{"fixed_in":"v1.3.0","issues":"ISSUE-006,ISSUE-007"},"created_at":"2026-09-09T17:55:47.460Z","updated_at":"2026-09-09T17:55:47.460Z","version":1,"hash":"77ad5ed20c8503dde71adfee08cadc5ecfab5f5a0107df3e4fb40162f8ee259e","tags":["P2","export","pack","verify","contract"],"status":"draft"}
{"type":"changelog","node_id":"fix004","field":"*created","old_hash":null,"new_hash":"77ad5ed20c8503dde71adfee08cadc5ecfab5f5a0107df3e4fb40162f8ee259e","timestamp":"2026-09-09T17:55:47.460Z","user":"dogfooding","version":1}
{"type":"packet_meta","packet_id":"pkt-9b1ce357-a227-4edd-a696-38be61a796c4","name":"dtp 功能回归任务包","version":"v1.1.0-regression","created_at":"2026-09-09T16:33:08.900Z","updated_at":"2026-09-09T17:55:47.460Z","root_node_id":"reg_root","metadata":{"purpose":"dogfooding回归"}}
{"type":"node","id":"fix005","parent_id":"f_fixlog","node_type":"document","title":"FIX-005 标题规范化与 query 路径校验（ISSUE-008/009/010 + OPTIM-002）","description":"query --path 不可解析改报 NOT_FOUND（与 get-path 一致，消除静默空集）；validateTitle 统一 trim 且 init 包名同规范化（消除三入口空白行为不一致）；零位置参数命令的多余参数错误附 --packet 指引；query --limit 截断时人类输出提示总数。新增 test/edges.test.js 7 组回归（含转义寻址/同位 mv/checkout 同版基线）","content":"","extensions":{"fixed_in":"v1.3.0","issues":"ISSUE-008,ISSUE-009,ISSUE-010,OPTIM-002"},"created_at":"2026-09-09T17:55:47.594Z","updated_at":"2026-09-09T17:55:47.594Z","version":1,"hash":"7690fab9e72d3684e3744d48e4fbfcd51f5e260c91ac1fc3366fbe16f5bd6048","tags":["P2","P3","query","title","cli","ux"],"status":"draft"}
{"type":"changelog","node_id":"fix005","field":"*created","old_hash":null,"new_hash":"7690fab9e72d3684e3744d48e4fbfcd51f5e260c91ac1fc3366fbe16f5bd6048","timestamp":"2026-09-09T17:55:47.594Z","user":"dogfooding","version":1}
{"type":"packet_meta","packet_id":"pkt-9b1ce357-a227-4edd-a696-38be61a796c4","name":"dtp 功能回归任务包","version":"v1.1.0-regression","created_at":"2026-09-09T16:33:08.900Z","updated_at":"2026-09-09T17:55:47.594Z","root_node_id":"reg_root","metadata":{"purpose":"dogfooding回归"}}
{"type":"node","id":"issue006","parent_id":"f_issues","node_type":"requirement","title":"ISSUE-006 --output 目录不存在时报 INTERNAL+原始 ENOENT","description":"export/pack --output 指向不存在目录时报 INTERNAL 并透出原始 ENOENT+Windows 绝对路径，Agent 会误判为工具缺陷而非路径错误","content":"【复现】dtp export n_root --format md --output no/dir/x.md --packet p.dtp --json\n【期望】清晰指明输出目录不存在及应采取的动作，exit 2\n【实际】{\"code\":\"INTERNAL\",\"message\":\"ENOENT: no such file or directory, open 'C:\\...\\no\\dir\\x.md'\"}，exit 1\n【影响】错误分类错误（INTERNAL vs 使用错误）；裸栈路径对 Agent 无行动指引；pack --output 同样中招\n【修复方向】写入前检查 dirname 是否存在，不存在 → USAGE「输出目录不存在：<dir>（请先创建）」","extensions":{"severity":"P2","area":"commands/export.js,commands/pack.js","fixed_in":"v1.3.0"},"created_at":"2026-09-09T17:51:55.239Z","updated_at":"2026-09-09T17:55:47.720Z","version":3,"hash":"7a116251200e0bf05d55099b0a1d26726633c9fd4995b3fed466671586864322","tags":["P2","export","pack","io"],"status":"approved"}
