{"type":"node","id":"fix004","parent_id":"f_fixlog","node_type":"document","title":"FIX-004 输出预检与 verify 错误契约（ISSUE-006/007）","description":"_shared.js 新增 assertWritableOutput（目录不存在→USAGE exit 2，export/pack 接入）；verify 对缺失包/目录包改抛标准 NO_PACKET 错误（原先返回 warnings:[] 的 checks 形状，按 warnings 判定的调用方会漏检）","content":"","extensions":{"fixed_in":"v1.3.0","issues":"ISSUE-006,ISSUE-007"},"created_at":"2026-09-09T17:55:47.460Z","updated_at":"2026-09-09T17:55:56.998Z","version":2,"hash":"eba2a333f0af3193b7003ca9013b767bebd83d6128c57d9d88bbb1346d2a46e7","tags":["P2","export","pack","verify","contract"],"status":"approved"}
