{"type":"node","id":"issue011","parent_id":"f_issues","node_type":"requirement","title":"ISSUE-011 query --limit 非严格整数被静默截断","description":"--limit 用 parseInt 解析，1.5/2abc/1e2/0x10 被静默截断为 1/2/1/0，与「需要是非负整数」报错契约矛盾","content":"【复现】dtp query --limit 1.5 → 1 条；--limit 2abc → 2 条；--limit 1e2 → 1 条；--limit 0x10 → 0 条\n【期望】非 ^\\d+$ 报 USAGE exit 2\n【实际】Number.parseInt 隐式截断，静默接受\n【影响】带单位/小数的 limit 得到意外条数而无提示；0x10 返回 0 条易被误判为空结果\n【修复方向】query.js 改严格整数校验（trim 后 /^\\d+$/）","extensions":{"severity":"P2","area":"commands/query.js"},"created_at":"2026-09-10T04:26:26.872Z","updated_at":"2026-09-10T04:26:26.872Z","version":1,"hash":"3f1bd2c108b1637fef34a62bb977ffcb5f3a2cfd64125e498601078f165d5299","tags":["P2","query","limit"],"status":"draft"}
{"type":"changelog","node_id":"issue011","field":"*created","old_hash":null,"new_hash":"3f1bd2c108b1637fef34a62bb977ffcb5f3a2cfd64125e498601078f165d5299","timestamp":"2026-09-10T04:26:26.872Z","user":"dogfooding","version":1}
{"type":"packet_meta","packet_id":"pkt-9b1ce357-a227-4edd-a696-38be61a796c4","name":"dtp 功能回归任务包","version":"v1.1.0-regression","created_at":"2026-09-09T16:33:08.900Z","updated_at":"2026-09-10T04:26:26.872Z","root_node_id":"reg_root","metadata":{"purpose":"dogfooding回归"}}
{"type":"node","id":"issue012","parent_id":"f_issues","node_type":"requirement","title":"ISSUE-012 query 非法 --type/--status 退出码为 1 而非 2","description":"INVALID_TYPE/INVALID_STATUS 属用法错误，main.js 退出码映射只覆盖 USAGE/EXISTS，Agent 误判为系统故障","content":"【复现】dtp query --type bogus --json → exit 1；--status bogus → exit 1\n【对照】多余位置参数 USAGE → exit 2；--ext 格式错 USAGE → exit 2\n【期望】两个 INVALID_* 归入用法错误 exit 2\n【实际】exit 1\n【影响】按退出码分类的 Agent 把枚举拼写错误当内部故障，重试/上报而非纠错\n【修复方向】main.js 退出码映射纳入 INVALID_TYPE/INVALID_STATUS","extensions":{"severity":"P3","area":"main.js"},"created_at":"2026-09-10T04:26:26.911Z","updated_at":"2026-09-10T04:26:26.911Z","version":1,"hash":"126444a292b80ee0f43012f522f9ca6fc94e584519f2fd0d8d0616f5dfb03ea7","tags":["P3","query","exit-code","contract"],"status":"draft"}
{"type":"changelog","node_id":"issue012","field":"*created","old_hash":null,"new_hash":"126444a292b80ee0f43012f522f9ca6fc94e584519f2fd0d8d0616f5dfb03ea7","timestamp":"2026-09-10T04:26:26.911Z","user":"dogfooding","version":1}
{"type":"packet_meta","packet_id":"pkt-9b1ce357-a227-4edd-a696-38be61a796c4","name":"dtp 功能回归任务包","version":"v1.1.0-regression","created_at":"2026-09-09T16:33:08.900Z","updated_at":"2026-09-10T04:26:26.911Z","root_node_id":"reg_root","metadata":{"purpose":"dogfooding回归"}}
{"type":"node","id":"issue013","parent_id":"f_issues","node_type":"requirement","title":"ISSUE-013 query 空过滤值静默返回全集（fail-open）","description":"--tag/--status/--keyword/--path 传空串时被静默忽略，查询退化为全表返回","content":"【复现】dtp query --keyword \"\" --json → 返回全部 6 节点；--tag \"\" / --status \"\" / --path \"\" 同\n【对照】--ext \"\" → USAGE（已拒绝空值），行为不一致\n【期望】显式空过滤值报 USAGE exit 2\n【实际】静默当作无过滤，返回全集\n【影响】fail-open：Agent 变量插值为空时本意过滤却拿到整包，可能据此错误决策\n【修复方向】query.js 对已提供但解析为空的 tag/type/status/keyword/path 抛 USAGE","extensions":{"severity":"P2","area":"commands/query.js"},"created_at":"2026-09-10T04:26:26.949Z","updated_at":"2026-09-10T04:26:26.949Z","version":1,"hash":"ff781884f290771620e6b6647d2fa6b549eeb20c2495e9ac9107ebba2d081f48","tags":["P2","query","validation","silent"],"status":"draft"}
{"type":"changelog","node_id":"issue013","field":"*created","old_hash":null,"new_hash":"ff781884f290771620e6b6647d2fa6b549eeb20c2495e9ac9107ebba2d081f48","timestamp":"2026-09-10T04:26:26.949Z","user":"dogfooding","version":1}
