{"type":"node","id":"optim007","parent_id":"f_optim","node_type":"knowledge","title":"OPTIM-007 query 未复用已建维度索引，全表扫描","description":"packet 已建 tagIndex/typeIndex/statusIndex，filterNodes 却遍历全部节点；10k 节点组合过滤 <100ms 达标","content":"【现状】filterNodes 从 [...packet.nodes.values()] 全表 O(n) 过滤，未用 packet 的维度索引\n【实测】perf 用例 10k 节点组合过滤 <100ms，满足 §6.1 预算\n【建议】数据量显著增大后可改索引求交；当前收益不足，登记暂缓","extensions":{"severity":"P4","area":"src/query.js"},"created_at":"2026-09-10T04:26:27.023Z","updated_at":"2026-09-10T04:26:27.023Z","version":1,"hash":"0af11c5826d0739735a101d74be00bb37bdc8bc23bda89c5479aa449042e53cc","tags":["P4","query","perf"],"status":"draft"}
{"type":"changelog","node_id":"optim007","field":"*created","old_hash":null,"new_hash":"0af11c5826d0739735a101d74be00bb37bdc8bc23bda89c5479aa449042e53cc","timestamp":"2026-09-10T04:26:27.023Z","user":"dogfooding","version":1}
{"type":"packet_meta","packet_id":"pkt-9b1ce357-a227-4edd-a696-38be61a796c4","name":"dtp 功能回归任务包","version":"v1.1.0-regression","created_at":"2026-09-09T16:33:08.900Z","updated_at":"2026-09-10T04:26:27.023Z","root_node_id":"reg_root","metadata":{"purpose":"dogfooding回归"}}
{"type":"node","id":"fix007","parent_id":"f_fixlog","node_type":"document","title":"FIX-007 query 参数校验收紧（ISSUE-011/012/013）","description":"--limit 改严格整数校验；空过滤值显式拒绝（消除 fail-open）；非法枚举退出码归入用法错误 2","content":"【根因】① query.js 用 Number.parseInt 解析 --limit，带小数/尾随字符/进制前缀被静默截断；② tag/type/status/keyword/path 空值经 split 后被 filter(Boolean) 丢弃，等价于无过滤（fail-open）；③ main.js 退出码映射只认 USAGE/EXISTS，INVALID_TYPE/STATUS 落到 1\n【改动】query.js：--limit 用 /^\\d+$/ 严格校验（trim 后），非匹配即 USAGE；新增 requireNonEmpty/requireNonEmptyRaw，对已提供但解析为空的 tag/type/status/keyword/path 抛 USAGE；main.js：退出码映射纳入 INVALID_TYPE/INVALID_STATUS → 2；package.json bump v1.4.0\n【验证】新增 test/query-edges.test.js 3 组：limit 非整数（1.5/2abc/1e2/0x10/-1/abc）均 USAGE exit2 且合法值不受影响；非法枚举 exit2；5 个空过滤值均 USAGE，逗号列表空段仍按原语义丢弃；60/60 测试全绿","extensions":{"fixed_in":"v1.4.0","issues":"ISSUE-011,ISSUE-012,ISSUE-013"},"created_at":"2026-09-10T04:27:03.143Z","updated_at":"2026-09-10T04:27:03.143Z","version":1,"hash":"5c65d272dcb04aa1f9ef3e2c56a9f993f4644f113c59aed603dbe9c7e06471e5","tags":["P2","P3","query","validation","exit-code"],"status":"draft"}
{"type":"changelog","node_id":"fix007","field":"*created","old_hash":null,"new_hash":"5c65d272dcb04aa1f9ef3e2c56a9f993f4644f113c59aed603dbe9c7e06471e5","timestamp":"2026-09-10T04:27:03.143Z","user":"dogfooding","version":1}
{"type":"packet_meta","packet_id":"pkt-9b1ce357-a227-4edd-a696-38be61a796c4","name":"dtp 功能回归任务包","version":"v1.1.0-regression","created_at":"2026-09-09T16:33:08.900Z","updated_at":"2026-09-10T04:27:03.143Z","root_node_id":"reg_root","metadata":{"purpose":"dogfooding回归"}}
{"type":"node","id":"issue011","parent_id":"f_issues","node_type":"requirement","title":"ISSUE-011 query --limit 非严格整数被静默截断","description":"--limit 用 parseInt 解析，1.5/2abc/1e2/0x10 被静默截断为 1/2/1/0，与「需要是非负整数」报错契约矛盾","content":"【复现】dtp query --limit 1.5 → 1 条；--limit 2abc → 2 条；--limit 1e2 → 1 条；--limit 0x10 → 0 条\n【期望】非 ^\\d+$ 报 USAGE exit 2\n【实际】Number.parseInt 隐式截断，静默接受\n【影响】带单位/小数的 limit 得到意外条数而无提示；0x10 返回 0 条易被误判为空结果\n【修复方向】query.js 改严格整数校验（trim 后 /^\\d+$/）","extensions":{"severity":"P2","area":"commands/query.js"},"created_at":"2026-09-10T04:26:26.872Z","updated_at":"2026-09-10T04:27:03.181Z","version":2,"hash":"ba7ade840c3d23a8654b841562b7dd7809cbdd26577516693cf6e3d6edd678ad","tags":["P2","query","limit"],"status":"review"}
{"type":"changelog","node_id":"issue011","field":"status","old_hash":"6ae048f08fcab44bfbc8463f074bfdb40f94c6bdf56d3aad9a7e1c05e5d5b5c1","new_hash":"fe82cb229e29dfc87a309c8d1679ff9f58be239c8e6f3ff52bc431efb3709b6b","timestamp":"2026-09-10T04:27:03.181Z","user":"dogfooding","version":2}
{"type":"packet_meta","packet_id":"pkt-9b1ce357-a227-4edd-a696-38be61a796c4","name":"dtp 功能回归任务包","version":"v1.1.0-regression","created_at":"2026-09-09T16:33:08.900Z","updated_at":"2026-09-10T04:27:03.181Z","root_node_id":"reg_root","metadata":{"purpose":"dogfooding回归"}}
{"type":"node","id":"issue012","parent_id":"f_issues","node_type":"requirement","title":"ISSUE-012 query 非法 --type/--status 退出码为 1 而非 2","description":"INVALID_TYPE/INVALID_STATUS 属用法错误，main.js 退出码映射只覆盖 USAGE/EXISTS，Agent 误判为系统故障","content":"【复现】dtp query --type bogus --json → exit 1；--status bogus → exit 1\n【对照】多余位置参数 USAGE → exit 2；--ext 格式错 USAGE → exit 2\n【期望】两个 INVALID_* 归入用法错误 exit 2\n【实际】exit 1\n【影响】按退出码分类的 Agent 把枚举拼写错误当内部故障，重试/上报而非纠错\n【修复方向】main.js 退出码映射纳入 INVALID_TYPE/INVALID_STATUS","extensions":{"severity":"P3","area":"main.js"},"created_at":"2026-09-10T04:26:26.911Z","updated_at":"2026-09-10T04:27:03.218Z","version":2,"hash":"dc4dce8938e343560f24f429831d8a48ee614670342bd44fb9d493fad1677554","tags":["P3","query","exit-code","contract"],"status":"review"}
{"type":"changelog","node_id":"issue012","field":"status","old_hash":"6ae048f08fcab44bfbc8463f074bfdb40f94c6bdf56d3aad9a7e1c05e5d5b5c1","new_hash":"fe82cb229e29dfc87a309c8d1679ff9f58be239c8e6f3ff52bc431efb3709b6b","timestamp":"2026-09-10T04:27:03.218Z","user":"dogfooding","version":2}
{"type":"packet_meta","packet_id":"pkt-9b1ce357-a227-4edd-a696-38be61a796c4","name":"dtp 功能回归任务包","version":"v1.1.0-regression","created_at":"2026-09-09T16:33:08.900Z","updated_at":"2026-09-10T04:27:03.218Z","root_node_id":"reg_root","metadata":{"purpose":"dogfooding回归"}}
{"type":"node","id":"issue013","parent_id":"f_issues","node_type":"requirement","title":"ISSUE-013 query 空过滤值静默返回全集（fail-open）","description":"--tag/--status/--keyword/--path 传空串时被静默忽略，查询退化为全表返回","content":"【复现】dtp query --keyword \"\" --json → 返回全部 6 节点；--tag \"\" / --status \"\" / --path \"\" 同\n【对照】--ext \"\" → USAGE（已拒绝空值），行为不一致\n【期望】显式空过滤值报 USAGE exit 2\n【实际】静默当作无过滤，返回全集\n【影响】fail-open：Agent 变量插值为空时本意过滤却拿到整包，可能据此错误决策\n【修复方向】query.js 对已提供但解析为空的 tag/type/status/keyword/path 抛 USAGE","extensions":{"severity":"P2","area":"commands/query.js"},"created_at":"2026-09-10T04:26:26.949Z","updated_at":"2026-09-10T04:27:03.254Z","version":2,"hash":"870e1802b70b131c9de4cafc681a6452805a13793fe7538d55670440d48837f3","tags":["P2","query","validation","silent"],"status":"review"}
