{"type":"node","id":"issue014","parent_id":"f_issues","node_type":"requirement","title":"ISSUE-014 history --limit 非严格整数被静默截断","description":"与 ISSUE-011 同源：--limit 用 Number.parseInt，1.5→1、2abc→2、1e2→1 被静默截断为版本数","content":"【复现】dtp history auth --limit 1.5 → 显示 1 个版本；--limit 2abc → 2 个；--limit 1e2 → 1 个\n【期望】非 ^\\d+$ 报 USAGE exit 2\n【实际】parseInt 隐式截断，静默接受\n【影响】调用方传带单位/小数时得到意外版本数，无任何提示\n【修复方向】history.js 改严格正整数校验（trim 后 /^\\d+$/ 且 >0），错误信息带原值","extensions":{"severity":"P3","area":"commands/history.js","fixed_in":"v1.5.0"},"created_at":"2026-09-10T06:22:50.249Z","updated_at":"2026-09-10T06:23:22.996Z","version":4,"hash":"63e78076e1868008e5d2c5d450e1bcc76a499c73b2bc3e9a00a52b71e457ec78","tags":["P3","history","limit"],"status":"approved"}
